dically violates...\n\nDashboard is common compliance strategy, acceptable. So 4.\n\nNeed output format: echo id exactly. For each subscale give <subscale>_evidence one sentence then <subscale> integer.\n\nOrder: paradigm_relatedness, originality, applicability, effectiveness, implementability, acceptability\n\nProvide evidence sentence then score.\n\nProbably JSON? The instruction says return rating... give \"<subscale>_evidence\" first then \"<subscale>\". Probably as lines.\n\nWill output structured.\n\nLet's produce:\n\nid: P1305\nparadigm_relatedness_evidence: ...\nparadigm_relatedness: 2\n...\n\nMake sure one sentence evidence.\n\nEnsure evidence sentence ends with period.\n\nProceed.",
